  "result": "{\"seen_before\": true, \"matches\": [\"PowerToys#37859\", \"PowerToys#46873\", \"PowerToys#46579\"], \"answer\": \"This crash has been reported before. It is a NullReferenceException in WPF's SetupDefaultValueConverter, thrown while handling a Windows system theme change (ThemeManager.OnSystemThemeChanged). Earlier reporters hit it after waking from hibernate or standby, or after a display or dock change. PowerToys#37859 is the main tracking ticket, and PowerToys#46873 was closed as a duplicate of it. No fix or workaround is recorded in those tickets. The original reporter said theirs was a one-time crash. If you are seeing it, restart PowerToys, which is safe to do after the crash. Please add your details to PowerToys#37859: version 0.98.1.0, Windows 10 build 19045, Microsoft Store install, and what you were doing when it happened. Tell us if it happens again, and attach a bug report ZIP if you can.\"}",
